error[SC0417]: `m` keeps function values in aggregates that differ between run-time paths
  --> /main/main.sol:17:13
   |
16 |           if (x < 100) {
17 | /             m = Maybe.Just(lam (a: word) -> word {
18 | |                     return a + 1;
19 | |                 });
   | |___________________^ the aggregate holding the function value differs between paths
20 |           }
   |
   = note: function values have no run-time representation: a value chosen by run-time control flow is compiled to a selector over a finite set of closures known at compile time
   = note: the constructor and the compile-time fields of an aggregate that holds a function value must be the same on every path
   = note: help: use the same constructor on every path, or keep the function value in its own variable
